			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> The fabric mod no longer bundles a required dependency. If you update the fabric mod, you now have to install [adventure-platform-mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/adventure-platform-mod) separately.\n\n* Add support for Paper 1.21.9/1.21.10 (0917d679ccfd261356065d8f9a9b8d4c4c33a1eb...992c511dd990c99602db2c0d8754a03990f107b2)\n* Add support for Fabric 1.21.9/1.21.10 (048f07f208e6e2c7aac341a5810583aee5154a2c...4ecffd06e5012a3770e55bec90491ae9733d1423)\n* Stop including adventure-platform mod for fabric (048f07f208e6e2c7aac341a5810583aee5154a2c)\n* Don't fail when failing to inject into fake players (#4, 89a56682e0fb7776ca8b4d261c6534e9de102978)\n* Ensure expired cache entries don't get used (594264dfc568824900c6b07dd731ec7754fdf425)\n* Retain cache entries while in queue (#5, 0bec5033b45ab6f8da34b2f5c74dad777c432b7f)\n* Automatically remove cache entries after they expire (#5, 1a636fb179a0997d3ee69d6089aadbcdbcf97f21)\n* Implement system properties for memory allocation logic (795e618bd27f7d14a88a65bc1acda198f0c72ca1)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MinceraftMC/BetterView/compare/v2.1.0...v2.1.1"
